          },
          {
            "text": {
              "status": "generated",
              "div": "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your 41-year-old female patient, admitted on 21/12/2020 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, she presented with fever, dry cough, and dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT confirmed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Blood tests and arterial blood gases revealed mild hypoxaemia. Pulse oximetry monitoring was performed continuously. She received supplemental oxygen therapy, antiviral and anti-inflammatory medication (dexamethasone), and intravenous fluid support. Physiotherapy was initiated to support respiratory recovery. Clinical condition improved steadily throughout the admission. She is discharged in recovering condition with instructions for home isolation, further rest, and follow-up in two weeks. Please monitor respiratory function and general recovery. Do not hesitate to contact me should any concerns arise.</div>"
            },
